WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
We cannot allow Kirchnerism to win in the city of Buenos Aires.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.600
That is why, along with Mauricio Macri's leadership, I decided to give up my candidacy.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.000
From this point of view, we believe that it is better to support Manuel Adorni

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.400
instead of being functional to Kirchnerism and giving the city to Santoro.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:28.000
That is why, when you go to vote tomorrow, I invite you to vote for Javier Milei's candidate.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.200
I invite you to vote for Adorni. Thank you very much.
